{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h8h0stcQIZEfdpUuqx1NAA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:42.828962+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h8h0stcQIZEfdpUuqx1NAA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Jgv6HohMMbaicnvJTyyWHzU58dXHS9XKPHpCTlpArQzAEicfx260yXxqNTJOHTfqtBMZaicyMyiaFdtw6Q0U0GNRCA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>清华大学深圳国际研究生院环境与生态研究院将举办“2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营”，活动旨在增进国内高校学生对环境与生态研究院的了解，扩展营员的学术视野，促进环境与生态研究院导师和全国各高校优秀大学生之间的交流。</span></span></p><p><span><span>本次活动以线下形式开展，开展时间为2025年7月7日-8日。本夏令营主要活动包括研究院介绍、走进课题组、实验室参观、校园参观、学术讲座、师生互动交流等。具体活动以入营通知为准。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Jgv6HohMMbaicnvJTyyWHzU58dXHS9XKPsVHLsj4xOiahI0jZTDLwia0SybzyMYeVJXFk9F0m6SsEIorkwGmBoRMQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>01 拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好、遵纪守法、身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span><span>02 全国高校本科在校生（2026年毕业），本科专业要求：环境、市政、生态、大气、化学、材料、生物、化工等相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>03 本科前5学期总评成绩在该校同年级本专业排名中名列前茅。</span></span></p><p><span><span>04 学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>05 诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>01 申请表(在线填写)；</span></span></p><p><span><span>02 有效身份证明(二代居民身份证)；</span></span></p><p><span><span>03 在学证明(学生证)；</span></span></p><p><span><span>04 本人自述：介绍本人专业背景、从事过的研究工作以及攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划等(1000字以内，申请人签字原件)；</span></span></p><p><span><span>05 外语水平证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>06 专家推荐信1封：请一位与申请学科相关的副教授(含)以上职称专家提供推荐信；</span></span></p><p><span><span>07 成绩单及排名证明：前5学期的各科成绩单与前5学期的年级总评成绩排名(需盖学校或院系教务部门公章)；</span></span></p><p><span><span>08 个人简历（不超过2页）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>09 其它材料：包括获奖证书复印件(学术类相关奖项)，能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物等。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、报名方式及时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 报名人通过问卷报名并按要求上传电子版材料，对应纸质版材料（一份）需在报名问卷开放期间寄达环境与生态研究院，逾期将按照材料不全算作无效报名</span></span><span><span>。所有报名材料恕不退还。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名时间：5月27日12:00-6月16日9:00</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名链接：</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jgv6HohMMbaicnvJTyyWHzU58dXHS9XKPNOHbzAvOibAQ47YYB6ib68qWsZCYaqmtiacVM7sPYQRP3xg7rKEYw9vaQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>https://vsxh18036q.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcnluRgsrzousmL5uMENaP9ab </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>纸质材料邮寄信息（</span><strong><span>邮寄顺丰，不接受到付</span></strong><span>）：</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：深圳市南山区西丽大学城能源与环境大楼</span></span></p><p><span><span>收件人：谢老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系方式：0755-26032009</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 入营通知：6月26日17点前。拟以邮件方式发送到报名时预留电子信箱，请保持邮件及手机畅通。未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、费用说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>本次夏令营为线下形式，入选营员需自行前往清华大学深圳国际研究生院。</span></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏令营不收取任何费用。入选营员交通自理。环境与生态研究院为营员购买意外保险。夏令营结束后环境与生态研究院提供：在深的用餐补贴50元/人/天，并为外地营员发放住宿补贴150元/人/天，最高按照夏令营活动天数进行补贴。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jgv6HohMMbaicnvJTyyWHzU58dXHS9XKP7jh3By0jcu28zAeJHFDPAE19nnXzicUVfPQoJ6gIuknGe8rL2oVRQwg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、研究院、师资、项目介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>硕士研究生</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>研究方向/项目名称</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><b><span>备注</span></b></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>085700</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>资源与环境</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>01 环境工程</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span></span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>0830J2</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>环境科学与新能源技术</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span> 02 全球环境与新能源（环境方向）</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>本项目为全英文授课</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>博士研究生</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><b><span>备注</span></b></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>083000</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>环境科学与工程</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>0830J2</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>环境科学与新能源技术</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>全英文授课</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><p><span><span>环境与生态研究院师资与项目详情，请访问环境与生态研究院官网。</span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jgv6HohMMbaicnvJTyyWHzU58dXHS9XKPRQnXjzD9f3yUD7kJCq5FOiaafOIA7VTZMukC6ickvCicQX8A017eIThFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><span>https://www.sigs.tsinghua.edu.cn/939/list.htm</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>张老师：0755-26418632</span></p><p><span>谢老师：0755-26032009</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：</span></p><p><span>admissions.iee@sz.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 学生需保证全部报名材料的真实性，对在夏令营过程中存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，或存在其他严重影响过程和结果公平公正行为的，一经查实，将撤销相应资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 如因不可抗力影响或上级部门出台新政策、安排或计划调整，导致夏令营工作安排或信息变化的，环境与生态研究院将做相应调整，最终以环境与生态研究院发布的相关通知为准。</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Jgv6HohMMbaicnvJTyyWHzU58dXHS9XKPjT7QZmrLr3h7GzolAw8qeD9qj2p2hjMqPiawwW0QgYWSJ0MD4ia7g3SQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0H1Xs6hpNU1icfJ7x50BUIwmLnFfh0C70bdSwITnM7pfNTdIx3iaoEcltFPKhFgJ140ecs821WLBYvQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Jgv6HohMMbaicnvJTyyWHzU58dXHS9XKPiaOnicibH5ic7PARKibVZiblayUKFk7ZeCjPrsAb969fjylHqg3OuqY4YDiaQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ec600bb24c013ea485ce08a3ea4023bae096894f17050aadd4e3765d793d9f83","textLength":1588,"sourceSha256":"9c80e066a8fc2a7c8c826c37958b09eef931ba6b2739d7cecaeeb206b23aae76","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0021d8c76da4e86c797a","title":"2025年清华大学深圳国际研究生院环境与生态研究院优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:42.828962+00:00"}
